<title>PHILIPPINES: Selecta Q1 net 16.3 million pesos.</title>
<headline>Selecta Q1 net 16.3 million pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Selecta Dairy Products Inc said on Monday it posted a pre-tax net income of 16.3 million pesos in the first quarter of its current fiscal year ending June from a year-ago net loss of 4.7 million pesos.</p>
</text>
